# Fitness components

## Location

All workout UI lives in `components/fitness/`. Layout chrome: `components/layout/` + `app-shell.tsx`.

## Patterns

- Export a named component + explicit `interface XxxProps`
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for class names
- Prefer fitness `Button`, `Input`, `Badge` from same folder for touch targets (`min-h-11` on buttons)
- Use shadcn `Checkbox` in `SetRow` — keep labels and `aria-label` on controls

## Key components

| Component | Role |
|-----------|------|
| `ExerciseCard` | Collapsible; shows progress ring `completed/total` sets |
| `SetRow` | Checkbox + target reps + actual reps input |
| `DailyProgressCard` | Day title + `role="progressbar"` with set counts |
| `DaySelector` | Horizontal day pills; `aria-pressed` |

## Props style

Pass data + callbacks; avoid fetching inside presentational components:

```tsx
onSetToggle?: (setId: string) => void;
onRepsChange?: (setId: string, reps: number) => void;
```

## Do not

- Put route logic inside fitness components
- Import page-level state into `components/ui/*`
